<title>USA: SCP Pool names Craig Hubbard as CFO.</title>
<headline>SCP Pool names Craig Hubbard as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>COVINGTON, La. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>SCP Pool Corp said Wednesday it had named Craig Hubbard as chief financial officer, replacing Maurice Van Dyke, who retired.</p>
<p>Hubbard formerly was SCP's controller.</p>
<p>SCP distributes swimming pool supplies.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
